  /**
   * Retrieve a paginated list of customer reviews for a specific product.
   *
   * This endpoint returns all reviews associated with the given product, sorted by creation date with the most recent reviews appearing first. Each review includes the customer rating (1-5 stars) and any optional text content submitted by the customer.
   *
   * The reviews serve as social proof for the product, helping prospective buyers understand real-world product quality and customer satisfaction. The product detail page displays these reviews along with the average rating and total review count.
   *
   * Reviews remain visible even after a product is deleted, preserving the customer's feedback history. For suspended sellers, review displays include a notice indicating the seller is currently unavailable.
   *
   * This operation is accessible to all users including guests for browsing purposes. No authentication is required to view product reviews.
   *
   * Related operations:
   * - POST /customers/orders/{orderId}/items/{itemId}/review - Create a new review (authenticated customers only, requires delivered order item)
   * - PUT /customers/reviews/{id} - Edit own review
