   * 1. Authentication: Verify administrator session from Authorization header.
   * 2. Extract search criteria from request body:
   *    - status: Filter by approval status (pending/approved/rejected)
   *    - createdAtFrom/createdAtTo: Filter by creation date range
   *    - reviewedAtFrom/reviewedAtTo: Filter by review date range
   *    - sellerEmail: Search by seller email (partial match)
   *    - sortBy: Sorting field (createdAt, status)
